\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 f}{\i\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid2688811\charrsid15491189 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 icata, }{\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid2688811\charrsid15491189 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 \hich\f0 
published in the Austrian Denkm\'e4\loch\f0 ler series many years ago, to which I had to contribute a continuo. Written a few years before Gluck\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0 s first master oper\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 a, }{
\i\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid2688811\charrsid15491189 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Orfeo, }{\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid2688811\charrsid15491189 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
it is an almost uninterrupted string of arias, much like so many operas by Handel but without the blessing of Handel\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0 
s wide range of invention and art of writing, and it is introduced by an overture whose inane emptiness defies comparison. One ma\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 y find better ones by any third rate contemporary of Gluck\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0 
s, say by Galuppi or Wagenseil. There is a tremendous gap between Gluck at his best and Gluck at his worst, and however sublime he can be in his great dramatic moments, he can be unspeakably insip\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 i\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
d when his deeper feeling is not aroused. His earlier Italian operas are hardly suitable for a complete edition.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Poor music, in point of fact, was abundant in Gluck\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0 s early time, the mid-eighteenth century, which was a period of questionable workmanship, s\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
trikingly in contrast to the preceding generation, represented by such composers as Bach and Handel, Couperin and Rameau, Scarlatti and Pergolesi. You see, there can be ample reasons for music to be forgotten, and in such cases an attempt to revive it is 
\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 f\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 utile.
\par }\pard \qj \fi306\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\tx306\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3434489 {\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid2688811\charrsid15491189 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
Owing to the ever increasing publicity in which musical events have taken place since the nineteenth century, the process of selection and elimination seems to have been much more reliable, and it is not easy to find forgotten music of this period t
\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
hat has not deserved its eclipse. Contributions of any importance could not easily remain totally disregarded. It always takes a considerable time for real values to emerge, but in the end the assessment is probably just. The amazing thing is how erratic 
