 extreme upper fifth of voices of exceptional range, because high notes are pretty. But today our singers, trained on Wagner, who share with Handel the glory of~ being great among the greatest writers for the voices, can play with Verdi, provided they hav
\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 e\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0  not to do with it too often.\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0  Had he asked any singer, he would have been told that the contrary was true.
\par }\pard \qj \fi306\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\tx306\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid2688811\charrsid15491189 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
On the opposite side Nietzsche, the most prominent philosopher of that period, who, after having been a c\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 lose friend and partisan of Wagner became his most stubborn critic, put against Wagner not only Bizet\hich\f0 \rquote 
\loch\f0 s }{\i\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid2688811\charrsid15491189 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Carmen, }{\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid2688811\charrsid15491189 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
a work of genius, but an obscure German composer, Peter Gast, to whom he happened to be personally attached. Well, Wagner\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0 s greatness, like Verd\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 i\hich\f0 \rquote \loch\f0 
s, could stand all pros and cons, and Peter Gast, like innumerable others, has long been forgotten. But public controversy on such a level is rather an obstruction to fair play in the formation of public opinion.
\par }\pard \qj \fi306\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\tx306\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid2688811 {\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid2688811\charrsid15491189 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 It remains to be seen how good or bad the\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
 present day influence of the mass media will turn out to be. We must learn to face the fact that a statement is not necessarily true because it has been printed or broadcast. Optimists may hope that there is a saturation point in swallowing the critical 
\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 o\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
pinions thrown at us incessantly. And this, in the end, may even offset the spurious results achieved by controlled public opinion as it is practised under totalitarian regimes. Experience shows that enthusiastic music lovers have a mind of their own; and
\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0  \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
a secret of the ballot that goes on permanently is that their vote counts threefold because it is maintained with conviction. Now you would like me to tell you which of the composers celebrated today will be forgotten in half a century: I am no soothsayer
\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 .\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0  Make your own guess, it is as good as mine.}{\lang1033\langfe2052\langnp1033\insrsid2688811 
